8590 0 obj
<<
/Title (Do: 1. Get a hot glue gun control worksheet. 2. Review safety by saying it out loud to yourself:           a. Elbows length from teammates           b. Wires           c. Plan glue path           d. When not in use, place hot glue gun back in a safe position 3. Carefully follow the glue paths on the worksheet. The goal is control! Focus on only applying enough glue to cover the path. Hint: after the glue is applied it will spread a bit depending on the heat. 4. Put the glue gun back in a safe position. Wait for the glue to cool. 5. Leave the work area better than you found it:           a. Glue gun and wires are in a safe position.           b. All materials and tools are where they are supposed to be.           c. If there is a name on the waiting list, please let them know it is their turn.)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 8572 0 R
/Prev 8609 0 R
>>
endobj
